  "EditorMetadata": {
    "Description": "P1a proof (GAP-1): per-subordinate ClearBehaviorEvent via FlowForEach over the commander\u0027s UnitRoster -- branch-free, latent-free body; iterates UnitRoster subordinates (curated UnitRosterOps.Count/Subordinate accessors, no raw fixed-array access in the graph) and publishes ClearBehaviorEvent{Entity=subordinate} once per subordinate (reuses P4 PublishEvent, wired from FlowForEach\u0027s CurrentItem out-pin -- NOT self). Proves the inline-for loop substrate \u002B curated source \u002B latent-free validation; GAP-1 substrate for P1b\u0027s AreAllAtBaseline.",
